# Deterministic analytics and scenarios

- Pure TypeScript/SQL only. **No LLM, network, randomness, or `Date.now()`** in formulas.
- Missing inputs, empty period, zero denominator → `{ value: null, unit, unavailableReason }`. Never `0`.
- Every KPI is defined in `docs/KPI_FORMULAS.md`; every scenario in `docs/SCENARIOS.md`. Change code and doc together.
- Observed/baseline and projected/estimated stay in separate fields; projections never overwrite observed data. Label estimates as estimates.
- Money keeps `numeric` precision; tests assert exact decimals.

```ts
// ❌ return orders / hours || 0;
// ✅ if (hours === 0) return unavailable("orders_per_hour", "zero_denominator");
```

Full guidance: `.cursor/skills/facilityiq-analytics-kpis/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/facilityiq-scenarios-projections/SKILL.md`.
